  BEIS/DESNZ, and Met Office sources) are used under the UK Open Government
  Licence v3.0 (https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/).
  Attribution: "Contains public sector information licensed under the Open
  Government Licence v3.0." ONS geographic lookup files additionally contain
  Ordnance Survey data (c) Crown copyright and database right. The Met Office
  HadUK-Grid data should be cited as required by the Met Office / CEDA.

- Synthetic data produced by Programs/synthetic_data_generator.do, and other
  files created by the authors, are released under the Creative Commons
  Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC-BY-4.0).

- The restricted ExactOne bank transaction data (Clear Score Technology Ltd)
  and the Living Costs and Food Survey (UK Data Service, SN 8583) are NOT
  redistributed in this package and remain subject to the terms of their
  respective providers.
